The 'style-snippets' folder contains individual CSS files that each implement specific styling adjustments and layout modifications for different UI components throughout the application. Each file targets a particular element or pane—such as sidebars, modals, panes, or terminal areas—providing focused styling solutions that can be easily managed and applied. These snippets work together to create a cohesive interface design while allowing for modular updates and optimizations across different screen sizes and layout requirements.
